BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Savor Sonoma - Live Fire & Wine
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T170000
UID:2608209gWmtChwvUeIgj-Wrc14TQ
DESCRIPTION:Taste the very best of wine country. Savor Sonoma is an immers
 ive\, three-day flagship culinary festival. Over one spectacular weekend\,
  you'll explore five distinct experiences alongside national culinary star
 s and celebrated local artisans\, all set against the backdrop of open-fla
 me cooking and world-class Sonoma wines. Ignite your senses across two sp
 ectacular worlds. Step onto the pool deck\, where the rich aroma of live-f
 ire cooking fills the air and chefs plate flame-kissed proteins right befo
 re your eyes. Then\, wander inside to explore a vibrant Sonoma village pou
 ring celebrated local wines\, craft beers\, and agave spirits.\n\nFriday -
  The Headliners' Dinner at AYA:\n\n3:00 - 4:30 p.m. Meet culinary Legend A
 aron Sanchez\n\n6:00 - 7:00 p.m. Welcome cocktails and canapes\n\n7:00 - 1
 1:00 p.m. Five-course collaborative tasting with Aarón Sánchez\, Bryan V
 oltaggio\, Michael Voltaggio\, Charlie Palmer\, and Roy Ellamar\n\nSaturda
 y - Live Fire & Vine:\n\n12:00 - 1:00 p.m. VIP Early Access\n\n1:00 - 5:00
  p.m. General Admission Opens\n\n10:00 p.m. - 1:00 a.m. After Hours at AYA
 \n\nVIP Includes: Early VIP Entry beginning at 12:00 p.m. & an exclusive i
 nvite to AYA's After-Hours Party.\n\nImportant event info:\n\nMust be 21 o
 r over to attend and present valid ID to enter. No refunds\, no exchanges.
LOCATION:Graton Resort & Casino
URL:https://savorsonoma.com/#
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
