BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MaMuse & The Real Sarahs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T000000
UID:260701pCak4_zcbkmPE3Oyc_9_-Q
DESCRIPTION:The Muse fell from the sky one night and landed in the spaces 
 between our heart beats. She instantly took a liking to the rhythm in our 
 chests\, and her sweet melody joined the pulse. One of us picked up father
  bass\, and thumped it’s belly in response. The other picked up father m
 andolin\, and plucked its ribs. Mother guitar and sister flute could not r
 esist being a part of such sweet merriment and soon joined in.  The Earth\
 , hearing the whole incident\,  called out words of inspiration and encour
 agement.  “Yes!… keep going!”  When the Earth calls\, one must liste
 n….. So we opened our hearts and let sweet harmony roll off of our tongu
 es. In unison our voices shot out into the deep of night and a star fell f
 rom the heavens\; the magic spark!  MaMuse is born. \n\nhen you’re singi
 ng I can feel the sky and hear her never-ending lullabye connecting every 
 single point of light As I listen I’m reminded why I am alive Won’t yo
 u sing it for me One more time?
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern Novato
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1038620817?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=2
 87&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Skincare Atelier at L’Occitane
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T170000
UID:260821g1xqkldlZ064_fhLwMhYdg
DESCRIPTION:Guests are invited to stop by and learn a full skincare routin
 e at dedicated stations: cleanse\, treat\, and moisturize\, step by step. 
 They can wash their face alongside the team and feel the difference\, or s
 imply watch and take notes — either way\, they’ll leave knowing exactl
 y what their skin needs and how to layer products the right way. It’s a 
 great excuse to bring a teenager along too\, since there are routines for 
 every age and skin type. Refreshments will be on hand\, because building a
  better routine should feel like a treat\, not a chore.\n\nWhile in store\
 , guests can take advantage of L’Occitane’s skincare event\, running t
 hrough October 6: a free cleanser with the purchase of a moisturizer and t
 reatment\, like one of the serums (some exclusions apply).
LOCATION:L’Occitane in Montgomery Village
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/the-skincare-atelier-at-loccitan
 e/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Naturalist Ed Series: Geology of Sonoma Mountain
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T170000
UID:260820e_vKwZIWqUWj19rORpv0FQ
DESCRIPTION:We can understand how the Earth has changed through time throu
 gh studying rocks\, geochemistry and geobiology. Join us to explore Osborn
  Preserve landscape through a geological lens. Find out how Sonoma Mountai
 n and the surrounding area was formed while hiking through the unique land
 scape at the Osborn Preserve. \n\nThis event is part of the Naturalist Ed
  Series. The event within this Series allows participants the option to be
 come Osborn naturalists to address Nature Deficit Disorder. No experience 
 required. Must be age 18 years or older.
LOCATION:Fairfield Osborn Preserve
URL:https://cei.sonoma.edu/sonoma-mountain-geol 
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
