BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fall Field Trip to the Wild Honeybee Populations
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T160000
UID:260820RBBP00hN7Ees0IyVHTo6FQ
DESCRIPTION:There is something truly awe-inspiring about witnessing honeyb
 ees flying in and out of their secretive wild abode nestled within a tree.
  Apis Arborea has been conducting fascinating research on wild honeybee po
 pulations at Galbreath Preserve for seven years. Come hear from the invest
 igators themselves about this project\, while traversing the preserve and 
 even participating in research yourself!
LOCATION:Galbreath Wildlands Preserve
URL:https://cei.sonoma.edu/Galbreath-bees
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
