BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Workshop: The Art of the Tablescape at Garrett Hardware
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T130000
UID:260813N44GCRv5gEWhmj3EN5FbWg
DESCRIPTION:Elevate your entertaining game just in time for fall and the h
 olidays! Join us for The Art of the Tablescape\, an interactive workshop w
 here you'll learn how to style stunning tables for summer gatherings\, hol
 iday dinners\, and more. We’ll cover place settings\, expert entertainin
 g tips\, table etiquette\, and creative decorating ideas. Afterward\, put 
 your new inspiration to use with **20% off the Home Store & Paint** all we
