BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Petite Landscapes in Acrylic
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T140000
UID:260808PvfCZiMx-0SdjRPPAJG43A
DESCRIPTION:Saturday · 1 Session\n\nDate & Time\n\nAugust 22\, 2026\n\n10
 :00 AM – 2:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 208\n\nCategory\n\nDrawing & Painti
 ng\, Workshops\n\nExperience Level\n\nBeginning\n\nAges\n\n18 and older\n\
 nRegistration Cost:\n\n$65\n\nMaterials Fee:\n\n$20\n\nTotal Registration 
 Cost:\n\n$85\n\nHave you always wanted to paint landscapes but don’t kno
 w where to start? Or are you curious about acrylics but haven’t taken th
 e plunge yet? In this class\, you’ll learn a simple technique to create 
 small\, abstract landscapes on 5” square wooden tiles using a limited pa
 lette of colors.You’ll be guided through the basics of acrylic paints an
 d mediums\, including surface preparation\, color blending with a flat bri
 stle brush\, and using different tools to add texture and detail. By the e
 nd of the class\, you’ll apply a final coat of medium to seal and protec
 t your artwork\, leaving you with 2-3 completed pieces to take home\, alon
 g with a little easel to display your favorite one.This class is perfect f
 or beginners\, though some prior painting experience is helpful. The proce
 ss you’ll learn can easily be applied to larger paintings or even collag
 e projects.All materials are provided. Feel free to bring snacks or a bag 
 lunch to eat while you work.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/petite-landscapes-in-acryli
 c/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
