 ollage Mixed Media Art**\n\nDiscover the beauty of encaustic art in this f
 un\, beginner-friendly workshop! Using layers of collage\, vibrant papers\
 , and warm beeswax medium\, you’ll create a one-of-a-kind mixed media ar
 twork full of depth\, texture\, and color.\n\nNo artistic experience is ne
 cessary. Katharine will guide you through each step of the process while i
 ntroducing you to the unique encaustic technique in an approachable and cr
 eative way.\n\nIn this workshop\, you will:\n\n• Learn the basics of enc
 austic (wax) collage techniques\n\n• Layer papers\, textures\, and wax t
 o create a unique mixed media artwork\n\n• Leave with a finished piece r
 eady to display\n\nAll materials and instruction are provided.\n\n**Detail
 s:**\n\n• $75 per person\n\n• Max 6 participants\n\n• Duration: 2 ho
 urs plus\n\n**Important Notes:**\n\n• Advance registration required\n\n
 • Workshops require a minimum of 4 participants\n\n• 72 hours notice r
 equired for a partial refund\n\n• Workshops are held outdoors\, under co
 ver\, at Made Local Marketplace in Montgomery Village
