BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Solo Show From Debra Seal - Human Landscapes Contours
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T190000
UID:260720BNd5tj17d0yXAU0YRklYpQ
DESCRIPTION:Debra Seal’s new exhibition\, Contours\, invites viewers to 
 encounter the human form with fresh eyes. By transforming the body into ab
 stract\, landscape-like compositions\, the work moves beyond familiar soci
 al assumptions and encourages an appreciation of its raw shapes\, texture\
 , and natural beauty. Building on the conversations prompted by her earlie
 r exhibitions\, particularly around the representation of women\, Seal pro
 vokes curiosity and acceptance in place of the prejudice and the preconcei
 ved notions embedded in our collective consciousness.
LOCATION:Studio LZ
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/a-solo-show-from-debra-
 seal-human-landscapes-contours/19443242/2026-08-22T16
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
