 t never stops\; sound set into continuous motion with unbroken energy. Thi
 s technically dazzling non-stop program begins with Paganini's Moto perpet
 uo and concludes with Mendelssohn's Piano Trio in D minor. For the most up
 -to-date program\, artist info\, and ticket availability\, click the ticke
 t link to visit the event page
