BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Expressions in Metal Exhibition
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T000000
UID:2608195DOurOeJVEybXP9_XooVaw
DESCRIPTION:Expressions in Metal In the Main Gallery\, Expressions in Meta
 l brings together nine Northern California artists who treat metal not as 
 a static material but as a living language. Curated by Vicky Kumpfer\, thi
 s exhibition highlights a range of contemporary practices rooted in metalw
 ork. Some artists forge\, cast\, or weld\, honoring the discipline's long 
 lineage of craftsmanship. Others push the material into unexpected territo
 ries\, experimenting with surface\, scale\, and form. Across the exhibitio
 n\, metal is bent\, stretched\, pierced\, patinated\, and even coaxed into
  gestures that contradict its reputation for hardness. What emerges is a c
 horus of works that carry the traces of heat\, pressure\, repetition\, and
  decision-marks that become expressive in themselves. These expressions re
 mind us that metal\, for all its industrial associations\, will record tou
 ch\, hold history\, and reflect the light around it. Expressions in Metal 
 invites viewers to consider how a material often associated with infrastru
 cture and industry can become a site of storytelling and imagination. In d
 oing so\, the exhibition honors the enduring dialogue between maker and ma
 terial-one forged through curiosity\, skill\, and the desire to transform 
 the elemental into the expressive. Participating Artists: Ray Degischer\, 
 James Ford Grant\, Byron B. Kim\, Sean Paul Lorentz\, Michael McGinnis\, M
 onty Monty\, Martin Munsun\, J. Nick Taylor\, Shoji Uemura Exhibition Date
 s: July 23 - August 29\, 2026 Opening Reception: Thursday\, July 23\, 5:30
 -7:30pm  RSVP HERE This exhibition celebrates the depth and range of conte
 mporary metalwork\, featuring artists who forge\, cast\, weld\, and experi
 ment with contrasting materials to transform industrial elements into expr
 essive works of art.
LOCATION:Petaluma Arts Center
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/expressions-in-metal-exhibition/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
