UID:260312E3ZiOyu1TkqoxGDPri5SKA
DESCRIPTION:Conservation Dinner Series: Robert D. Rubin of Name of the  Pa
 cific Manta Research Group joins us in the elephant room after dinner to g
 ive a talk about manta rays. The conservation dinner series is complimenta
 ry to all dinner guests. If you want to attend this presentation\, please 
 call our reservations team at \\(707\\) 566-3667 or \\(800\\) 616-2695\, a
 nd they can book it for you. Dinner starts at 7:00 PM. About the Speaker: 
 Dr. Rubin is the founder and director of the Pacific Manta Research Group\
 , which focuses heavily on the manta rays of the Eastern Pacific based at 
 the Univ. of CA Bodega Marine Laboratory. Dr. Rubin's research takes him t
 o the Gulf of California\,the Revillagigedo Archipelago\, and beyond in hi
 s quest to conserve and understand these enigmatic creatures. A non-scient
 ific manta ray presentation was given as an invited TEDx talk here in Sant
 a Rosa a few years ago \\(see Robert Rubin TEDx Sonoma on the web\\).
LOCATION:Safari West
URL:https://safariwest.com/calendar/safari-west-presents-pacific-manta-res
 earch-group/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
