BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:HONKY TONK ROADSHOW & JAMBOREE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T180000
UID:260810kbPUEaSRZEix93HTuez18A
DESCRIPTION:FOPPIANO VINEYARDS and BLUE BRIDGE BOOKING present a summer af
 ternoon of music and artisan pizza at the HONKY TONK ROADSHOW AND JAMBOREE
 .\n\nFeaturing CLEMENTINE DARLING\, RANDY ROSS\, plus an open mic jam wit
 h guest musicians.\n\n 3–6 PM\n\n$10 ADVANCE (free to Club) | $15 AT TH
 E DOOR\n\nAll Ages Welcome\n\nWine Available for Purchase\n\nWood-fired Pi
 zza Direct from the Oven\n\nFriendly\, Leashed Dogs Welcome\n\nNo Outside 
 Alcohol or Glass Containers On the Lawn Please\n\nABOUT THE ARTISTS:\n\nCL
 EMENTINE DARLING is an Americana Folk Singer-Songwriter with her heels dug
  deep in San Francisco Bay Area’s music scene. Originally from Seattle\,
  Washington\, Darling busked her way down the West Coast in 2010\, on a ro
 ad trip that led her to put down roots in Sonoma County\, California. The 
 two locals influenced her debut 11:11 EP and subsequent Live At The Lost C
 hurch— a collection of introspective songs and soulful ballads\, with un
 dertones of Seattle 90’s grunge.\n\nIn May 2023\, Darling released her t
 hird independent album Bootstraps EP\, a collection of songs that spin a t
 ail of overcoming\, hope\, and chasing dreams on horseback. Darling has fo
 und her confident\, soulful voice playing music all around the Bay Area\, 
 and at festivals including The Emerald Cup\, sharing the bill with Margo P
 rice and Rising Appalachia\, SXSW\, Railroad Square Music Festival and Bal
 anced BreakFEST.\n\nFind her at www.clementinedarling.com\, or on Instagra
 m @clementinedarlingmusic\n\nRANDY ROSS is an Americana and country songwr
 iter. Fresh off the release of his EP “Hard Days\, Soft Nights\,” the 
 Nashville‑via‑Phoenix singer blends heart‑on‑sleeve lyrics\, dusty
  barroom stories\, and a warm\, lived‑in voice. Find him at @randyrayros
 s
LOCATION:Foppiano Vineyards
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/foppianovineyards/event/618779/honky-tonk-
 roadshow-jamboree
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
