 perience Level\n\nBeginning\n\nAges\n\n18 and older\n\nRegistration Cost:\
 n\n$75\n\nMaterials Fee:\n\n$5\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$80\n\nBrigh
 ten your day by creating beautiful crepe paper sunflowers in this beginner
 -friendly workshop! You’ll learn the fundamentals of paper flower making
 \, including cutting\, shaping\, coloring\, and assembling crepe paper pet
 als and leaves to create a lifelike bloom. With step-by-step guidance and 
 all materials provided\, this relaxing and creative class is perfect for c
 omplete beginners or anyone looking to explore a new craft. By the end of 
 the workshop\, you’ll take home some stunning handmade sunflowers that w
 ill last for years—no prior experience required.Please bring a bag lunch
  or snacks and a beverage/water bottle.
