BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Creative Seasonal Cooking with Erin Shallat
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260824T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260824T113000
UID:2607289p2CO5WmNkqxtPVKKVQGSw
DESCRIPTION:Schedule\n\nMonday & Wednesday · Weekly\n\nDate & Time\n\nAug
 ust 3 – 26\, 2026\n\n10:00 AM – 11:30 AM\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 109\, Rot
 ary Kitchen\n\nCategory\n\nCulinary Arts\, Wellness\n\nExperience Level\n\
 nBeginning\n\nAges\n\n18 and older\n\nRegistration Cost Per Class:\n\n$10\
 n\nMaterials Fee:\n\nIncluded\n\nTotal Registration Cost Per Class:\n\n$10
 \n\nDiscover the joy of cooking with beautiful\, locally grown produce in 
 a relaxed\, inspiring kitchen environment. These intimate classes are desi
 gned to spark creativity\, build confidence\, and make everyday meal prep 
 feel simple\, sustainable\, and deeply satisfying. Classes are offered two
  times per week on Monday and Wednesdays from 10:00–11:30 AM throughout 
 August\, followed by a casual lunch and Q&A where guests can connect\, ask
  questions\, and continue the conversation around food\, wellness\, and se
 asonal living. Rather than a formal step-by-step cooking course\, each ses
 sion is primarily demonstration-based with occasional hands-on participati
 on. Every class highlights a seasonal fruit or vegetable and explores seve
 ral delicious ways to prepare and enjoy it using fresh\, vibrant ingredien
 ts. The first class focuses on creating a well-equipped kitchen for effort
 less meal prep\, including:\n\nSmart pantry\, refrigerator\, and freezer s
 tocking\n\nEssential cooking tools and equipment\n\nOrganizing for ease an
 d efficiency\n\nSetting up a kitchen that supports healthy\, creative cook
 ing\n\nWith produce harvested from Erin’s own gardens\, participants wil
 l experience an abundance of fresh seasonal ingredients while learning app
 roachable techniques and flavorful recipes that can easily be recreated at
  home. Classes are  welcoming\, personal experience with plenty of opport
 unity for questions\, conversation\, and inspiration. Simple. Fresh. Creat
 ive. Nourishing cooking without the fuss.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/creative-seasonal-cooking-w
 ith-erin-shallat/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
