BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Timothy Williams' Poetry Salon: Chill August Blue - Poetry & Jazz
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260825T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260825T190000
UID:260817K_mi04xV70iCeaBjggmHzA
DESCRIPTION:Chill August Blue: Poetry & Jazz at Barrel Proof Lounge\n\nThe
  Poetry Salon returns to its traditional last Tuesday of the month with a 
 special evening bringing together live jazz\, poetry\, prose\, and music i
 n Downtown Santa Rosa.\n\nChill August Blue: Poetry & Jazz takes over the 
 theater at Barrel Proof Lounge on Tuesday\, August 25 from 5–7 PM for an
  intimate early-evening gathering of writers\, musicians\, readers\, and l
 isteners.\n\nLIVE JAZZ\n\nChappell & Dave Holt bring the music\, setting t
 he mood for an evening where jazz and the spoken word share the stage.\n\n
 FEATURED POETRY & PROSE\n\nElizabeth Herron Joanna Wheeldin Jack Crimmins 
 N’game Gray Steve Shain and his bass\n\nPlus Wendy Nicholson joins us as
  our guest host.\n\nAnd the Poetry Salon isn't just for the featured write
 rs. Open mic slots are available — come early if you'd like a chance to 
 share your own poetry\, prose\, or spoken word from the Barrel Proof stage
 .\n\nThe Poetry Salon is a relaxed\, welcoming listening-room experience w
 here the words get the attention they deserve. Come to read\, come to list
 en\, or just settle in with a drink and enjoy two hours of poetry and live
  jazz.\n\nTuesday\, August 25\, 2026 5–7 PM Barrel Proof Lounge 501 Mend
 ocino Ave at 7th Street Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nAlways free. Always free po
 pcorn. 21+\n\nFor Poetry Salon information: Timothy Williams — Jaxon's P
 ress jaxonspress@gmail.com\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for 
 all sorts of good times ahead.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://AugustPoetrySalon.eventbrite.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
