 ng one-of-a-kind hand-painted trays created by Artstart Lead Artists and o
 ther Sonoma County artists.​\n\n​All proceeds support Artstart’s wor
 k empowering Sonoma County youth through art\, mentorship\, and real-world
  creative experiences.​​
