 AM – 7:00 PM\\)\, with Live Music on the Patio from 4:00 PM – 7:00 PM.
 \n\nThis Wednesday is also a Sip & Support Day! We are partnering with Sun
 rise Horse Rescue and their mission to rescue\, rehabilitate\, and provide
  sanctuary for abused\, neglected\, and at-risk horses in Napa County\, of
 fering them a second chance at life while educating the public on equine w
 elfare\, preventing slaughter\, and connecting people with horses through 
 therapy and learning programs. They aim to create a safe haven for vulnera
 ble horses and promote the value of horses beyond riding\, fostering human
 -animal bonds for community well-being.\n\n20% of all wine and food sales 
 from the entire day will be donated directly to support their impactful wo
 rk.\n\nDine In: Savor Street Food & Live Music\n\nThe full Street Food Men
 u is available from 11:30 AM to 6:30 PM. Savor your meal with warm hospita
 lity in the Clif Family Tasting Room and Patio.\n\n Happy Hour starts at 4
 :00 PM as Live Music runs from 4:00 PM – 7:00 PM.\n\nWine Club Members a
 lways receive preferred pricing on wines and food truck orders.
