BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Willie Watson & Erin Rae | Fully Seated
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260826T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260826T235900
UID:260701R6eAGCritUKMLHsWRcZFCw
DESCRIPTION:Willie Watson & Erin Rae\n\nMystic Theatre\n\nThis event is se
 ated.\n\nWe’re thrilled to welcome Willie Watson and Erin Rae to the Mys
 tic Theatre this August for an evening of heartfelt folk songs from two of
  Americana’s most distinctive voices.\n\nWillie Watson helped introduce 
 a generation of listeners to the deep roots of American folk music through
  his work with Old Crow Medicine Show and alongside artists like Gillian W
 elch and David Rawlings. Now\, after years spent interpreting the songbook
 \, he’s stepped forward with his first collection of deeply personal ori
 ginal songs.\n\nJoining him is Nashville songwriter Erin Rae\, whose lumin
 ous blend of indie-folk\, cosmic country\, and thoughtful songwriting has 
 earned praise from Pitchfork\, NPR\, Rolling Stone\, and beyond.\n\nIf you
 r record shelf includes Gillian Welch\, Jason Isbell\, Sierra Ferrell\, Pu
 nch Brothers\, The Avett Brothers\, or Nathaniel Rateliff\, this is a show
  worth circling on the calendar.\n\nWILLIE WATSON and ERIN RA
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre & Music Hall
URL:https://wl.eventim.us/event/willie-watson-and-erin-rae-or-fully-seated
 /696203?afflky=MysticTheatrehttps://wl.eventim.us/event/willie-watson-and-
 erin-rae-or-fully-seated/696203?afflky=MysticTheatre
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Basic Roadside Bike Repair
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260826T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260826T200000
UID:260630ThPgthI_QU-OHjBft3UrtA
DESCRIPTION:In this hands-on class we will focus on flat repair and basic 
 bike maintenance. We will also review items for you to consider carrying i
 n your tool kit. As time permits we may delve into more specialized areas
  like chains and cables. BRING YOUR BIKE! This class will focus on tubes
 \, but is suitable for those who ride a tubeless set up. Wear appropriate
  clothing and bring a cloth for wiping grime. You might get a little grea
