DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260828T200000
UID:260821D03kglhQekyBtyCIA9SoEQ
DESCRIPTION:Step into a higher class of cannabis. Elevated Sessions is an 
 intimate\, sommelier-led tasting experience featuring award winning Decibe
 l Farms indoor flower and curated for the true cannabis connoisseur.  \n
 \nJoin us for a refined 60 minute session designed to awaken the senses. Y
 our cannabis sommelier will guide you through 4 exceptional cultivars — 
 exploring their terpene profiles\, aromas\, flavors\, and effects — whil
 e you savor a drink from the natural soda bar\, curated snacks\, and palat
 e cleansers.\n\nThis is more than a tasting — it’s an immersive journe
 y through craft cannabis\, where every detail is designed to elevate your 
 evening\, from the intimate atmosphere to the exclusive perks awaiting gue
 sts.\n\nDate & Sessions\n\nDate: Friday\, August 28\, 2026\n\nOne Session:
  6:00 PM\n\nCapacity: 36 guests \\(very limited!\\)\n\nWhat’s Included\n
 \nEnjoy a refreshing Natural Soda – A cannabis-infused palate opener\n\n
 Guided Tasting of 4 Curated Strains –Guests enjoy exclusive cultivar dro
 p\n\nTasting Passport – Track aromas\, effects\, and personal favorites\
 n\nCharcuterie & Palate Cleansers – Light bites designed for the session
 \n\nMeet The Grower – Learn how this award-winning flower was grown\n\nE
 xclusive Perks – Discounts \\+ access to limited drops\n\nTicket Tiers \
 \(Limited to 16 Guests per Session\\)\n\n6:00 PM Tasting - $75: Includes 
 🌱 $50 Goodie Bag\, 4 Curated Tastings\, Tasting Passport\, Natural Soda
  Bar\, Snacks & Exclusive Deals\n\n21\\+ Only | DCC \\# C12-0000420-LIC\n\
 nEvent Terms & Conditions\n\nThis event is 21\\+ only. Valid government-is
 sued ID is required for entry. By attending this event at the Mercy Wellne
 ss Lounge\, you acknowledge that photography and video recording may take 
 place. Images and footage may be used by Mercy Wellness for marketing and 
 promotional purposes across various channels\, without compensation. Ticke
 ts are non-refundable unless otherwise stated. Event details\, timing\, or
  programming are subject to change.\n\nCannabis consumption is limited to 
 designated areas and must comply with all applicable local and state regul
 ations. Please consume responsibly.\n\nBy entering the venue\, you agree t
 o comply with all house rules and venue policies.
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://eventhi.io/events/elevated-sessions-at-the-lounge-at-mercy-828
 26-14825
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
