 et Series. A relaxed\, all-inclusive evening of Chappellet wines\, wood-fi
 red pizza\, and live music\, set against the backdrop of breathtaking view
 s from Pritchard Hill.\n\nThis limited summer experience takes place on th
 e last Saturday in June\, July\, and August\, and includes:\n\n·    
      A curated picnic pack with dining essentials \\(Go Vinos\, compos
 table plates\, and cutlery\\)\n\n·         Caesar Salad\, Artisan
 al Wood-Fired Pizza\, & Chappellet Chardonnay Brittle\n\n·       
   Valet parking\n\n·         Chappellet wine by the glass—Char
 donnay\, Pinot Noir\, Signature Cabernet Sauvignon\n\n·         E
 xclusive savings on pre-selected bottles & merchandise to be enjoyed with 
 your picnic \\(inquire after reserving your ticket\\)\n\nGuests are encour
 aged to bring picnic blankets or lawn chairs. Limited communal table seati
 ng is available on a first-come\, first-served basis.
