DESCRIPTION:Nerd Halen - A Van Halen Rock n' Roll Comedy Experience Like N
 o Other with Hal Sparks!\n\nThe Mighty Nerd Halen is the explosive result 
 of combining the music of Van Halen\, a legendary band known for in-your-f
 ace sex appeal and guitar wizardry\, with the hilarious antics of the most
  staunch nerds\, seemingly taken directly out of an 80’s B-movie. Nerd H
 alen is a Big Rock/Comedy Experience positively unlike any other\, where u
 napologetic Rock n' Roll and unending hilarious Comedy is delivered by wel
 l-known actor/comedian Hal Sparks and his musicians who've worked in music
 al comedy theater and backed up over 40 major label recording stars in mul
 tiple genres. Nerd Halen has to be seen\, heard\, and experienced to be be
 lieved. So tape up your old glasses and get ready for a party!\n\nPLUS SPE
 CIAL GUEST!  Live Music starts at 8PM  Free Popcorn! $20 online/$25 door
  LIMITED SEATING!!! Purchase a VIP table for 4 for $125 (only 6 available)
  21+\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good time
 s ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/nerd-halen-a-van-halen-rock-n-roll-comedy
 -experience-like-no-other-tickets-1992790839044?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Valley Games X and Helen's 50th featuring New Monsoon
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T170000
UID:260819jYUxa4ySBUiPeRFW55PNWg
DESCRIPTION:This summer\, we are thrilled to celebrate Valley Games X\, t
 he tenth anniversary of this one-of-a-kind event that could only happen h
 ere in the San Geronimo Valley.\n\nPart Olympics\, part block party\, and 
 entirely Valley-style\, the Valley Games have become one of the Community 
 Center’s most beloved traditions — bringing together neighbors of all 
 ages for a day of friendly competition\, laughter\, teamwork\, and unforge
 ttable community memories.\n\nHeld on Saturday\, August 29\, Valley Games 
 X is a family-friendly event where Valley villages compete in Olympic-styl
 e games for glory across a wildly entertaining lineup of events\, includin
 g Cornhole\, Hacky Sack\, Ping Pong\, Chess\, Baking\, an Obstacle Course\
 , Basketball Hot Spot\, and more.\n\nRepresenting villages from across the
  Valley\, teams including the Lagunitas Lightning\, Forest Knolls Trolls\,
  San Geronimo Running Salmon\, Woodacre Wild Turkeys\, Nicasio Newts\, and
  the Townies will come together for a full day of camaraderie\, community 
 spirit\, and good-natured rivalry.\n\nNew to the Valley Games? It’s easy
  to join the fun. Teams are made up based on the village you live in — o
 r identify with — so simply sign yourself or your family up\, and we’l
 l place you on your village team the day of the event.\n\nAs Valley Games 
 X marks ten years of community fun\, this year’s celebration also honors
  someone who has helped shape the spirit behind the event from the very be
 ginning: the Community Center’s own Helen Ferlino. To top off the festiv
 ities\, beloved Bay Area band New Monsoon will rock the Community Center
  Courtyard for an afternoon birthday celebration.\n\nLocation : Lagunitas 
 Middle School Campus\n\n10am - Registration Opens - Middle School Amphithe
 ater\n\n10am - Pancake Breakfast begins - LOFT\n\n11am - Opening Ceremonie
 s & Village Cheer Parade\n\n11:30am - Games Begin\n\n1:30pm - Games Close\
 n\nLocation: San Geronimo Valley Community Center Courtyard\n\n1:45pm - Fi
 nale - Village Freeze Dance\n\n2:00pm - Awards and Closing Ceremonies\n\n3
 :00pm - New Monsoon Concert in the Courtyard
LOCATION:San Geronimo Valley Community Center
URL:https://sgvperformingarts.eventcalendarapp.com/valley-games-featuring-
 new-monsoon
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
