DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T130000
UID:260817PwmLi9VAMUaAKb_GEZ_TVQ
DESCRIPTION:Explore the Osborn Preserve and learn about reptile biology\, 
 how they are affected by climate and habitat loss\, and what we can do to 
 support the conservation of these amazing animals! This event is part of t
 he Naturalist Ed Series. The event within this Series allows participants 
 the option to become Osborn naturalists to address Nature Deficit Disorder
 . No experience required. Must be age 18 years or older
LOCATION:Fairfield Osborn Preserve
URL:https://cei.sonoma.edu/sonoma-mountain-reptiles
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
