BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Montgomery Village Wellness Weekend: Mat Pilates with Club Pilates
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T111500
UID:260812mjTBD3Ovu0OiAoARZfOx4g
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an outdoor mat Pilates session hosted by Club Pila
 tes\n\nJoin us for an outdoor mat pilates class at Montgomery Village host
 ed by Club Pilates. This full-body workout helps to enhance core strength\
 , flexibility and body awareness through controlled movements. Designed to
  be low-impact and accessible\, this class is perfect for all fitness leve
 ls—whether you're just getting started or looking to deepen your practic
 e.\n\nFollowing class\, enjoy live music and complimentary refreshments. P
 lus\, attendees are invited to stop by ME SPA at 728 Farmers Lane to pick 
 up product samples\, try a complimentary LED demo\, and book an appointmen
 t on the spot for 10% off. Snap a photo at their spa selfie station and en
 ter for a chance to win a 50-minute massage or facial. L'Occitane will als
 o be on-site guiding a DIY facial experience at their wash station\, the p
 erfect post-workout treat.\n\nBy registering and attending this class\, yo
 u acknowledge that you have read and understand this Release and Waiver an
 d accept and agree to the terms and provisions contained in this Release a
 nd Waiver.\n\nThis outdoor event will be held atThe Courtyard\, located be
 tween Salt & Straw (700 Village Court) and Monti's (714 Village Court). Pl
 ease wear layers\, sunscreen and don't forget your sunglasses!\n\nMats wil
 l be provided\, but you are welcome to bring your own mat for additional s
 upport. Please bring your own water bottle.
LOCATION:Montgomery Village Courtyard
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/wellness-weekend-3/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rail Arts District (RAD) Napa Annual Action Art Fest
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T160000
UID:260812ikTwXzSfgkG_9FvRVwS4cA
DESCRIPTION:For one vibrant day\, Action Avenue transforms into an open-ai
 r arts festival celebrating the creative spirit of Napa. Following an inau
 gural festival that welcomed more than 500 attendees\, Action Art Fest ret
 urns with even more art\, entertainment\, and interactive experiences for 
 all ages.\n\nExplore live mural painting and artist demonstrations\, join 
 community art-making activities\, enjoy live typewriter poetry\, music and
  performances\, and meet local artists and makers throughout the day. An e
 xpanded selection of local food and beverage offerings rounds out the expe
 rience\, bringing art\, creativity\, community\, and the flavors of Napa t
 ogether in the Rail Arts District.
LOCATION:Rail Arts District
URL:https://www.radnapa.org/rad-action-art-fest-2nd-annual/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
