BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Real Neato Music Fest
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T220000
UID:2606026bkNise_JUigJJJ_4krflw
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to bring you the 8th Annual Real Neato Music Fe
 stival on Saturday\, August 29\, 2026 from 2-10PM. at the Rio Nido Roadhou
 se in Guerneville\, California.\n\nThis single-day festival takes place in
  West Sonoma County’s most picturesque setting—the Russian River Valle
 y. Two stages provide non-stop live music from legendary and up-and-coming
  Bay Area Indie bands. Majestic coastal redwoods provide the perfect backd
 rop for the best little festival in Northern California.\n\nIt's a fun-fil
