DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260902T200000
UID:260817zmmqHR19LUWI1wTaa-aQjw
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Open Studios Preview Exhibition Party is the ce
 lebration wrapping up the SR Open Studios preview show that is on display 
 at the Finley Center now! Artists who are part of the Santa Rosa Open Stud
 ios weekends have their art on display in one space.\n\nThe 9/2 party is a
 n evening of art\, great food and drink and music to kick off the 2026 San
 ta Rosa Open Studios. meet the participating artists\, plan your itinerary
 \, and purchase studio passports to use during your tour and enter into an
  art-inspired prize raffle!\n\nMusic by the Jack Gobetti Quartet \\*featur
 ing Lynne Morrow\n\nRefreshments provided by The Spinster Sisters\n\n\\*Dr
 ess to impress\, inspired by your favorite art or artist!
