BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mere Seconds + Insight/Incite 20/20 Photography Exhibition
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260903T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260903T180000
UID:260724hO_KIllgfUiL99qhkTR9tA
DESCRIPTION:The University Art Gallery at Sonoma State University is pleas
 ed to present two concurrent photography exhibitions: Mere Seconds: Andre
 w Owen and Insight/Incite 20/20: PhotoAlliance 20th Anniversary Portfolio.
  On view from September 3 through October 17\, 2026\, the exhibitions are
  guest-curated by Bay Area artist and Bass & Reiner Gallery co-founder Chr
 is Grunder. Together\, the exhibitions showcase the breadth of contemporar
 y photographic practice\, bringing distinct artistic voices into conversat
 ion through shared explorations of the natural and built world\, and the w
 ays people move through both.
LOCATION:Sonoma State University
