BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dgiin
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260904T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260904T220000
UID:260819OXz1hxOKxEeRQxju4EZUFg
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County's favorite French gypsy band returns for an unfo
 rgettable evening of movement and magic. Dgiin is a vibrant melting pot of
  French\, American\, and Quebecois artists performing a repertoire in Fren
 ch infused with Spanish guitar\, brass\, violin\, bass\, percussion\, and 
 rich sibling harmonies. Undefinable and unapologetically danceable\, their
  sound refuses to fit in a box-and you won't stay in your seat for long. N
 amed "Best World Band" by the North Bay Bohemian\, Dgiin blends French-Gyp
 sy-Funk with Django-inspired flair and flamenco fire. For nearly two decad
 es\, they've captivated audiences with high-energy performances and a musi
 cal journey spanning Paco de Lucia to Django Reinhardt\, with vocals remin
 iscent of Edith Piaf. Come ready to revel. TICKETS: BUY IN ADVANCE! TICKET
 S AT THE DOOR ZONE C ONLY. Zones A & B ensure a seat. Zone C has limited s
 eating\, plus standing room. Doors open 6:30pm.
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/dgiin/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
