  Level\n\nAll Levels\n\nAges\n\n18 and older\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$100
 \n\nMaterials Fee:\n\nAll Materials Provided\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n
 \n$100\n\nJoin instructor Gerardo Diaz for a hands-on class built around t
 he bright\, refreshing flavors of ceviche. You’ll learn how to select th
 e freshest seafood\, balance the citrus marinade that “cooks” it to pe
 rfection\, and bring everything together with the right herbs\, aromatics\
 , and finishing touches. Gerardo will share the techniques and tips that m
 ake this dish a standout\, whether you’re serving it as an appetizer or 
 the centerpiece of a meal. Perfect for cooks of every level\, you’ll lea
 ve with a fresh skill set and the confidence to recreate it at home. Sign 
 up today and bring your appetite to the Sonoma Community Center.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
