 endor:** TBA\n\n945theband is an alt-rock band that blends the gritty emot
 ion and energy of '90s and 2000s rock with their own fresh\, authentic sou
 nd. Lead singer Sophia’s emotive and powerful vocals have quickly become
  a signature of the band. Her unique ability to feel every note has earned
  her accolades\, including Bohemian Magazine’s “**Best Lead Vocalist**
 ” in the North Bay. The magazine also named 945 “**Best Rock Band**”
