BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Amelia Day
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260910T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260910T000000
UID:260813j00govm7WkK_SVgLcw75Nw
DESCRIPTION:It took a world-shaking breakup for Amelia Day to find her tru
 e sound — and herself. She\n\nembraces the full range of her influences 
 with EGO TRIP\, a genre-bending EP stacked high\n\nwith alt-rock guitars\,
  pop hooks\, swooning keyboards\, and the sharp songwriting of a lifelong\
 n\nstoryteller. Inspired by the sudden collapse of a college romance\, EGO
  TRIP finds room for\n\nanger\, liberation\, and healing\, with Amelia nod
 ding not only to the folk music she discovered as\n\na child in the Pacifi
 c Northwest\, but also the electrifying empowerment of her favorite 1990s\
 n\nfrontwomen. The result is a collection of melody-driven songs that brea
 the new life into classic\n\nsounds\, largely written in her adopted homet
 own of Nashville and recorded at Bear Creek\n\nStudio in her home state of
  Washington. With EGO TRIP\, Amelia Day creates her own\n\ngeography.
LOCATION:Little Saint
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1039486706?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=2
 87&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
