 ginning\n\nAges\n\n17\\+\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$265\n\nMaterials Fee:\n
 \n$30\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$295\n\nA class for first timers! Alw
 ays wanted to dive in and get your hands dirty on the wheel but didn’t k
