BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Love Letter to the Tomato at Songbird
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260910T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260910T210000
UID:260821dLWnhEtMuUyVo5Qg5Vr62Q
DESCRIPTION:A Love Letter to the Tomato at Songbird Parlour in Glen Ellen 
 is a one-night-only celebration of one of the season's most beloved crops.
  This special five-course tasting menu puts farm-fresh tomatoes from local
  growers in the spotlight\, showcasing their versatility through creative 
 techniques and playful presentations. Guests can expect a vibrant progress
 ion of sweet\, savory\, smoky\, and bright flavors designed to highlight t
 he tomato in unexpected ways. An optional beverage pairing is also availab
 le\, featuring tomato-inspired selections to complement the menu. Come hun
 gry and curious for an evening dedicated to the incredible flavors of peak
  tomato season. The five-course tasting menu is available for $85 per pers
 on\, with the optional beverage pairing available as an additional experie
 nce. The full menu will be announced soon.
LOCATION:Songbird Parlour
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/a-love-letter-to-the-tomato-at-songbird/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
