 tions and supplies for grape picking will be distributed. At 5:00am the gr
 ape pick begins as daylight breaks\, followed by our annual champagne brea
 kfast at dawn while processing & stomping grapes. After breaking for pers
 onal time\, the celebration continues with Harvest Dinner Saturday at 5:00
