DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable celebration of Sonoma County’s 
 vibrant culinary and beverage scene! Indulge Sonoma brings together over 5
 0 of the region’s finest restaurants\, wineries\, breweries\, and distil
 leries for an afternoon of flavor\, fun\, and discovery. Savor signature b
 ites\, sip bold local pours\, and experience the very best our community h
 as to offer — all in one delicious event.\n\nGuests can expect a lively\
 , immersive atmosphere filled with music\, connection\, and creativity. Co
 me taste\, explore\, and indulge your senses — only at Indulge Sonoma.\n
 \nChoose from General Admission or upgrade to VIP for early access and exc
 lusive lounge perks. Secure your spot now — tickets are limited and expe
 cted to sell out!\n\nThis is a 21+ event.
LOCATION:The Backdrop
URL:https://becomingindependent.org/events-2/indulge-sonoma-2
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
