DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T193000
UID:2607077U5Het-BE0ijLaR8QazaXA
DESCRIPTION:The Russian River Zine Club is a collaborative space to create
  and share zines in community every third Wednesday of the Month \\(from 6
 -7:30pm\\). Each month there will be a mini-demonstration of a binding\, i
 llustration\, or crafting technique\, along with time to work on your own 
 projects and to share your favorite zines with the group. The library will
  provide basic supplies like paper\, glue sticks\, scissors\, etc.\, but y
 ou should feel free to bring your own materials and tools. You can also br
 ing zines that you are excited about to share out with others. Snacks will
